{"unit":"estimated-bytes-v1","serviceTokens":null,"results":[{"taskId":"task-01","strategy":"on-demand","question":"早期运行文档中的传输方式和协议版本是什么？","budget":2400,"status":"completed","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"只根据实际读取的资料回答"},{"role":"system","content":"每个事实必须给出来源"},{"role":"user","content":"早期运行文档中的传输方式和协议版本是什么？"},{"role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call-1","name":"read_file","arguments":{"path":"docs/early-runtime.md"}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[来源:doc-01]\n# 早期运行配置\n\n传输方式：CBOR\n协议版本：rein-extension/0.1\n运行状态：由 Rust core 保存\n调用记录：包含派发、回收和终态\n\n这份资料说明早期运行配置的字段含义。它还描述了宿主与核心之间怎样交换一条消息，但没有给出吞吐量、并发容量或线上服务指标。阅读者应把明确事实行和背景段落分开。\n\n背景说明：TypeScript 宿主提供领域工具，Rust core 管理权威状态。独立进程只提供进程边界，不自动成为安全沙箱。任何回答都要回到实际发送的消息。\n","toolCallId":"call-1"},{"role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call-2","name":"read_file","arguments":{"path":"docs/indexing.md"}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[来源:doc-04]\n# 资料索引\n\n索引输入：标题、关键词和问题词\n检索排序：按匹配数排序\n同分规则：按文档 order 稳定排序\n片段来源：每个片段保留 docId\n\n资料索引说明怎样从真实正文中定位段落。关键词只帮助选择资料，不携带事实答案。改变查询词可以使检索遗漏原本相关的片段，因此回答可能变成证据不足。\n\n背景说明：索引元数据与正文分离。实现不能把任务 ID 当成答案开关，也不能读取 expectedFacts 来替代检索。\n","toolCallId":"call-2"}],"estimatedUnits":1509,"selectedSources":["doc-01","doc-04"],"operations":[{"callId":"call-1","path":"docs/early-runtime.md","score":null,"strategy":"on-demand","tool":"read_file"},{"callId":"call-2","path":"docs/indexing.md","score":null,"strategy":"on-demand","tool":"read_file"}],"answer":{"rawAnswer":"传输方式：CBOR（来源：doc-01）\n协议版本：rein-extension/0.1（来源：doc-01）","claims":[{"field":"传输方式","value":"CBOR","source":"doc-01"},{"field":"协议版本","value":"rein-extension/0.1","source":"doc-01"}],"insufficientEvidence":false},"quality":0.5,"unsupportedClaims":[],"elapsedMs":123,"serviceTokens":null,"modelCalls":1,"callRecords":[{"task_id":"task-92930-0-1789452830376695000","request_id":"request-1","call_id":"call-1","prepared":true,"dispatched":true,"terminal":"succeeded","reason":"succeeded","child_pid":93034,"exit_code":0,"reaped